{"about_the_game":"In <strong>Mr. Sleepy Man</strong>, you play as a sleepy guy who's up way past his bedtime and out of control!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657740/extras/sleepy_glide.gif?t=1748208048\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657740/extras/moon_steam.gif?t=1748208048\" /></div> <br>Welcome to <strong>Bedtime Town</strong>, the perfect place to get a good night's sleep...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657740/extras/btt__2_.gif?t=1748208048\" /></div><br><br>Make a mess of everything you find and turn Bedtime Town against you! <br>This sandbox adventure is filled with comical hijinks, outrageous characters, and platforming action!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657740/extras/out_of_control.gif?t=1748208048\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657740/extras/carcrash.gif?t=1748208048\" /></div><br><br>Interactivity is key! Mr. Sleepy Man can pick up and play with every item he finds. You\u2019ll need to use the environment to your advantage if you want to create chaos and find every secret this game has to offer!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657740/extras/grab_donut.gif?t=1748208048\" /></div><br><br><i>Be careful what you dream of...</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657740/extras/grabhand.gif?t=1748208048\" /></div>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images